      "body": "\n### Translate Pro 是一款面向开发编码、技术阅读与问题排查场景的翻译插件，帮助程序员更高效地理解信息、定位问题并保持沉浸式开发体验。\n\n#### 覆盖开发流程中的核心翻译场景\n- Hover 翻译\n   <img width=\"1394\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f74cb33-026b-4bc2-8ccc-e557b48516f1\" />\n- 插件详情沉浸式翻译\n   <img width=\"1592\" height=\"1076\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50717bde-4c46-418d-8de3-82fbcd5aef4e\" />\n- markdown预览沉浸式翻译\n   <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1338\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf515424-acea-47ff-a98e-8bf2b196054c\" />\n- 终端文本翻译\n   <img width=\"1598\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f46aa937-ed85-4721-8aa5-d5d87c92fcb0\" />\n- 选中文本翻译\n   <img width=\"1902\" height=\"997\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee82c0d0-ca48-490a-92ca-a1aa87fce50f\" />\n- 支持多翻译 Engine 与自定义翻译API\n  <img width=\"1140\" height=\"804\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46d2507a-0ec2-43d6-a028-2ca84542be21\" />  \n\n\n#### 相关资料\n- 官网：[https://translate.yanxuewen.cn/](https://translate.yanxuewen.cn/)\n- 插件地址：https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=yxw007.vscode-translate-next\n- 视频教程：https://space.bilibili.com/3546754775517426",
